{"id":"bezuslovno","lemma":"безусловно","pos":"adv","rank":1308,"glosses":["certainly, undoubtedly, absolutely","there is no doubt that..."],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8d/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D1%83%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D1%83%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"«Это не так!» – «Безусловно, это так».","en":"\"That's not so!\" \"It certainly is so.\"","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,null,null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"so"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"wrong"]]},{"text":"Он, безусловно, умный.","en":"He certainly is smart.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"clever"}]},{"text":"Поезд, безусловно, идёт быстро.","en":"The train is sure going fast.","words":[{"g":"train"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"идти"},{"g":"fast, quickly, rapidly"}]},{"text":"Вы, безусловно, интересный человек.","en":"You certainly are an interesting person.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"interesting"},{"g":"person"}]},{"text":"Времена безусловно изменились.","en":"Times have certainly changed.","words":[{"g":"time","l":"время"},null,{"g":"to change","l":"измениться"}]}]}